  (text "Q1 IRLML6344: N-MOSFET, 30V VDS, RDS(on) max 37mΩ at VGS=2.5V; pins 1=G, 2=S, 3=D." (at 36 286 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95))) (uuid "7bc00000-0000-4000-8000-000000000107"))
  (text "D1 1N4148W: anode at K_MOTOR_SW, cathode at K_3V3_MOTOR_HOLD; 150mA maximum average rectified current." (at 36 292 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95))) (uuid "7bc00000-0000-4000-8000-000000000108"))
  (text "K_3V3_MOTOR_HOLD is intentionally unsourced. No battery, charger, protection or 3V3 power-path is connected." (at 36 298 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95))) (uuid "7bc00000-0000-4000-8000-000000000109"))
  (text "C1/C2 are local motor-rail bypass/reservoir placeholders. Final capacitance/derating and motor PWM must be tested." (at 36 304 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95))) (uuid "7bc00000-0000-4000-8000-000000000110"))
  (text "Button is GPIO4 to GND; GPIO0/strap, GPIO2/8/9 boot straps, GPIO10 RGB and USB D-/D+ remain reserved." (at 36 310 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95))) (uuid "7bc00000-0000-4000-8000-000000000111"))
